<SubSection title="Tool Life" id="Tool Life">
<p>Terms: cutting speed <InlineEquation equation="V" />, tool life <InlineEquation equation="t" />, constants <InlineEquation equation="n" /> and <InlineEquation equation="C" /></p>
<Itemize>

    <Item>Taylor equation: <InlineEquation equation="Vt^n = C" /></Item>

</Itemize>
</SubSection>
<SubSubSection title="Example Problem" id="Example Problem">

<DisplayEquation equation="Vt^{0.2} = C" title="" />

<p>If <InlineEquation equation="V" /> is reduced by 30%</p>

<DisplayEquation equation="\\frac{t_2}{t_1} = \\left(\\frac{1}{0.7}\\right)^5 \\approx 6" title="" />

